{"title": "Rih'al", "pageid": 52734, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rih'al", "categories": ["Characters", "Characters in the Rosymorn Monastery", "Characters in Act One", "Githyanki", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Ancient Githyanki Warrior</h2><div class=\"pi-media-collection\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<ul class=\"pi-media-collection-tabs\">\n\t\t<li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing current\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-1\">In-game</li><li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-2\">Portrait</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content current\" id=\"pi-tab-1\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Rih%27al_Ancient_Githyanki_Warrior.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"In-game\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Rih%27al_Ancient_Githyanki_Warrior.png/300px-Rih%27al_Ancient_Githyanki_Warrior.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Rih%27al_Ancient_Githyanki_Warrior.png/300px-Rih%27al_Ancient_Githyanki_Warrior.png.webp 1x, /w/images/3/3e/Rih%27al_Ancient_Githyanki_Warrior.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game\" width=\"270\" height=\"206\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-2\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Rih%27al.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Rih%27al.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Rih%27al.png 1x, /w/images/8/84/Portrait_Rih%27al.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"full name\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Full Name</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">M'lar Rih'al</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Scout, Author</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>M'lar Rih'al</b> is a scout who discovered the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery\">Rosymorn Monastery</a> is now a location for a githyanki Crèche.\n\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">Looks like a githyanki, if the armour is anything to go by.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><small>— <b>Tav</b></small>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The corpse of M'lar Rih'al is atop <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery\">Rosymorn Monastery</a>, it is marked as <i>Ancient Githyanki Warrior</i>. It is likely the initial scout who found Rosymorn Monastery and wrote reports about it. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gremishka\" title=\"Gremishka\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/25px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/38px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/50px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gremishka\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png/25px-Portrait_Gremishka.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Portrait_Gremishka.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gremishka\" title=\"Gremishka\">Gremishka</a> infestiation was noted, as well as the valuable goods found underground. Later on the githyanki stormed the monastery, killed its residents and founded <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a> beneath it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Slate_(item)\" title=\"Githyanki Slate (item)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Slate_(item)\" title=\"Githyanki Slate (item)\">Githyanki Slate (item)</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Account_of_the_Establishment_of_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Account of the Establishment of Crèche Y'llek\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Account_of_the_Establishment_of_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Account of the Establishment of Crèche Y'llek\">Account of the Establishment of Crèche Y'llek</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\